      "content": "• Book: Satyarth Prakash.",
      "id": "wmnomtt"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Rejected idol worship and caste by birth.",
      "id": "mqi0d32"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Promoted Shuddhi (reconversion) movement.",
      "id": "0ifarsc"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Established DAV institutions and Gurukul Kangri.",
      "id": "gbywydy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Advocated Vedic infallibility.",
      "id": "yk8on7a"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Played role in nationalist and cow-protection movements.",
      "id": "moe6rsg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Criticism: revivalist rigidity.",
      "id": "to9jmap"
    },
